<title>NORWAY: Statoil to test well at Danish Siri prospect.</title>
<headline>Statoil to test well at Danish Siri prospect.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) will begin testing a third exploration well at the Siri prospect in the Danish sector of the North Sea, the company's Status Weekly newsletter said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The production test in block 5605/13 will begin this week on the Maersk Enhancer jack-up rig.</p>
<p>Two wells, Siri-1 and Siri-2, in block 5604/20 southwest of Siri-3 have already been drilled on the 6/95 licence.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
